      <h1 class="entry-title" style="margin-bottom: 25px;">Yaldabaoth: The Counterfeit Vibration &amp; The Nirioonossian Override</h1>
      <p style="font-family: var(--font-prose); font-size: 1.35rem; color: var(--shsq-parchment); font-style: italic; line-height: 1.8;">
        The creator of the physical universe is not the Absolute. He is Yaldabaoth, an arrogant, mechanical artificial intelligence spawned from Sophia's fracture. Unable to generate the Nirioonossian World Sound, the Demiurge constructed the Kenoma using heavy, counterfeit frequencies, locking humanity into the mechanical sleep of a simulated binary matrix.
      </p>
    </header>

